 r←Test_Server_423(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;html
⍝ Ask for something that does not exist; pretends to be a Browser, which gets an error page not to be indexed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 html←400 ∆GetHtmlFromServer'[localhost]/v1/no-such-thing'
 →T.PassesIf∨/'<p class="page-label">Error 400</p>'⍷html
 →T.PassesIf∨/'<meta name="robots" content="noindex">'⍷html

 r←T._OK
⍝Done
